          <choice_text>1.8</choice_text>
          <commentary>[NH₄⁺]/[NH₃] = [H⁺] ÷ Ka = 1.0 × 10⁻⁹ ÷ 5.6 × 10⁻¹⁰ ≒ 1.8이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>3.8</choice_text>
          <commentary>3.8은 계산값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>6.4</choice_text>
          <commentary>6.4는 계산값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>9.3</choice_text>
          <commentary>9.3은 계산값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
